[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Ollama: Free GPU / Load
Comment=Toggle the loaded model in/out of VRAM. Loaded → unload to free the card for games. Unloaded → load it back. A resident model can starve a game of VRAM; this is the switch.
Exec=/usr/local/bin/bobctl toggle
Icon=bob-gaming
Terminal=false
Categories=Game;
Keywords=bob;ai;gpu;game;vram;ollama;
# Hidden on the live ISO (no Bob/Ollama to load until installed). The installer
# reveals it on the desktop profile — see profiles.sh.
NoDisplay=true
